l=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/28-47.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/28-47.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-Qasas 28:47 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Kuma bã dõmin wata masĩfa ta sãme su ba sabõda abin da hannayensu suka gabãtar, su ce: &quot;Yã Ubangijinmu! Don me ba Ka aiko wani Manzo zuwa gare mu ba, har m\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/28.html\">Sura Al-Qasas</a> › Aya 47</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Qasas 28:47</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَوْلَا أَن تُصِيبَهُم مُّصِيبَةٌ بِمَا قَدَّمَتْ أَيْدِيهِمْ فَيَقُولُوا رَبَّنَا لَوْلَا أَرْسَلْتَ إِلَيْنَا رَسُولًا فَنَتَّبِعَ آيَاتِكَ وَنَكُونَ مِنَ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Kuma bã dõmin wata masĩfa ta sãme su ba sabõda abin da hannayensu suka gabãtar, su ce: &quot;Yã Ubangijinmu! Don me ba Ka aiko wani Manzo zuwa gare mu ba, har mu dinga bĩn ãyõyinKa, kuma mu kasance daga mũminai?&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأخبر: أن ما قدمت أيديهم قبل إرسال الرسل سبب لإصابتهم بالمصيبة، ولكن لم يفعل سبحانه ذلك قبل إرسال الرسول الذي يقيم به حجته عليهم،<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/454</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذا يدل على أن ما قدمت أيديهم سبب لنزول المصيبة بهم، ولولا قبحه لم يكن سببا، لكن امتنع إصابة المصيبة لانتفاء شرطها، وهو عدم مجيء الرسول إليهم،<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 1/248</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s28a47\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/28-44.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (28:44)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/28-48.html\">Aya ta gaba (28:48)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/28-48.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Qasas 28:48 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sa&#x27;an nan a lõkacin da gaskiya ta jẽ musu daga wurin Mu, suka ce: &quot;Don me ba a bã shi kamar abin da aka bai wa Mũsã ba?&quot; Shin kuma ba su kãfirta ba da abin\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/28-48.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-Qasas 28:48 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sa&#x27;an nan a lõkacin da gaskiya ta jẽ musu daga wurin Mu, suka ce: &quot;Don me ba a bã shi kamar abin da aka bai wa Mũsã ba?&quot; Shin kuma ba su kãfirta ba da abin\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/28.html\">Sura Al-Qasas</a> › Aya 48</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Qasas 28:48</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَلَمَّا جَاءَهُمُ الْحَقُّ مِنْ عِندِنَا قَالُوا لَوْلَا أُوتِيَ مِثْلَ مَا أُوتِيَ مُوسَىٰ أَوَلَمْ يَكْفُرُوا بِمَا أُوتِيَ مُوسَىٰ مِن قَبْلُ قَالُوا سِحْرَانِ تَظَاهَرَا وَقَالُوا إِنَّا بِكُلٍّ كَافِرُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sa&#x27;an nan a lõkacin da gaskiya ta jẽ musu daga wurin Mu, suka ce: &quot;Don me ba a bã shi kamar abin da aka bai wa Mũsã ba?&quot; Shin kuma ba su kãfirta ba da abin da aka bai wa Mũsã a gabãnin (wannan)? suka ce: &quot;Sihirõri biyu ne suka taimaki jũna,&quot; kuma suka ce: &quot;Lalle ne mũ, mãsu kãfirta ne ga dukansu?&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ويعني التوراة والقرآن،<cite>«الجواب الصحيح لمن بدل دين المسيح» 1/118</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وإذا كان الأمر كذلك فهو سبحانه يذمهم على ترك اتباع ما أنزله في التوراة والإنجيل وعلى ترك اتباع ما أنزله في القرآن ويبين كفرهم بالكتاب الأول وبالكتاب الثاني:<cite>«الجواب الصحيح لمن بدل دين المسيح» 2/452</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s28a48\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/28-47.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (28:47)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/28-50.html\">Aya ta gaba (28:50)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","surah/28.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Sura Al-Qasas — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tafsirin Sura Al-Qasas — Ma&#x27;anonin Alkur&#x27;ani a cikin maganganun Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/surah/28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/surah/28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/surah/28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/surah/28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/surah/28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/surah/28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com